SUMMARY:🕯️ Theodor Herzl Yahrzeit reminder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270214T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270214T163000
UID:reminder-20270214-c09d46fd-1
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Theodor Herzl\, whose 16th Yah
 rzeit occurs on Monday\, February 15\, corresponding to the 8th of Adar I\
 , 5787.\n\nTheodor Herzl’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Sunday\, Februa
 ry 14 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customar
 y to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your l
 oved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their me
 mory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
